From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erich Seifert <dev@erichseifert.de>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 14:34:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Record bin clips in a PostProject sidecar on save

Saving film.kdenlive records each file-backed bin clip in film.pproj:
an imported asset with PostProject's content fingerprint, keyed by
kdenlive:control_uuid. A clip Kdenlive relinked gets its new location
confirmed. The project file is not changed, and failures are only
logged.

The PostProject C++ wrapper reports errors as exceptions, so the
adapter is the one source file compiled with exceptions.

